scan of <root>
add   shop.test      127.0.1.1
add   api.shop.test  127.0.1.1
add   web.shop.test  127.0.1.1  port 3001
link  ./docker/compose.dev.yaml · DOCKER_HOST_IP=127.0.1.1 in its .env
set   apps/web/.env:1
      - API_URL=http://localhost:3001
      + API_URL=http://web.shop.test
set   apps/web/.env:2
      - DATABASE_URL=postgres://***@localhost:5432/shop
      + DATABASE_URL=postgres://***@shop.test:5432/shop
fix   apps/web/package.json:2
      - "scripts": {"dev": "next dev -p 3001"}
      + "scripts": {"dev": "next dev -H 127.0.1.1 -p 3001"}
note  api.shop.test: lodo can't tell its dev server's port; set it with e in the list
note  api.shop.test: nest has no host option; make the app listen on the name's address
note  web: Next 16.2+ refuses hot reload from other hosts; add allowedDevOrigins: ['shop.test', '*.shop.test'] to next.config

run lodo here and press y to add, link and set these; e names the project or an app
